{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49846","headline":"更漏子 二 · 冯延巳","name":"更漏子 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夜初长，人近别，梦觉一窗残月。\n鹦鹉卧，蟪蛄鸣，西风寒未成。\n红蜡烛，弹棋局，牀上画屏山绿。\n褰绣幌，倚瑶琴，前欢泪滴襟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"冯延巳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49846.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49846","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}